### Backend API

#### [NEW] [settings.ts](file:///d:/Kerson%20Company%20Tech/TSM%20EX/TSM%20EX%20JAN%202026/tsm%20ex%20omni/server/src/routes/settings.ts)

Endpoints:
- `GET /api/settings/llm/providers` - Listar providers
- `POST /api/settings/llm/providers` - Criar provider
- `GET /api/settings/llm/models` - Listar modelos
- `POST /api/settings/llm/models` - Adicionar modelo
- `PATCH /api/settings/llm/models/:id` - Atualizar modelo
- `DELETE /api/settings/llm/models/:id` - Remover modelo
- `POST /api/settings/llm/models/:id/test` - Testar modelo
- `POST /api/settings/llm/models/:id/set-default` - Definir como padrão
- `POST /api/settings/llm/api-keys` - Salvar API key (encrypted)
- `DELETE /api/settings/llm/api-keys/:providerId` - Remover key

